name: Stored external results disclose partial history without completing a Scan
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/stored_results.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 records marked verified by the external engine | partial-status
paste-file: @ART/import-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 fuzz:import · 1 imported | partial-import
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/stored_results.py @TMP_TARGET @ART imported
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · partial | partial-receipt
keys: Escape
resize: 160x48
live-snap: partial-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: partial-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: partial-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: partial-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: partial-40x12
expect: partial
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-page-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-page-two-40x12
ask: Does the stored-result receipt make the partial outcome and external verification authority clear without implying a new Scan?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/stored_results.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalidate
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 30 Could not read stored findings index | invalid-index
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/stored_results.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · failed | failure-receipt
expect: Recorded error
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · partial | historical-partial
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/stored_results.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the original partial receipt separately from the later failed read?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
